WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.451
Welcome to the complete MedMatch overview! Let me walk you through everything our platform offers.

00:00:09.451 --> 00:00:18.902
MedMatch is your all-in-one career platform for life sciences and engineering professionals. Whether you're a job seeker or a recruiter, we have powerful tools designed just for you.

00:00:18.902 --> 00:00:28.353
For job seekers, your personalized dashboard shows matched opportunities, your Trust Score, and quick actions. Our AI-powered job search helps you find remote, hybrid, and on-site positions across the industry.

00:00:28.353 --> 00:00:37.804
Upload your resume and let our AI extract your skills automatically. Track all your applications in one place and prepare for interviews with our AI coaching tools.

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:47.256
For recruiters, manage your hiring pipeline with our comprehensive dashboard. Create shareable application links, track candidates through every stage, and post jobs to reach top talent.

00:00:47.256 --> 00:00:56.707
Your data privacy is our priority. We use industry-leading encryption, comply with GDPR and CCPA, and give you full control over your information.

00:00:56.707 --> 00:01:06.158
Our AI features are transparent. We use AI to match skills with opportunities and provide personalized recommendations, but we never use your data to train external models.

00:01:06.158 --> 00:01:15.609
Ready to take the next step in your career journey? Sign up today and discover what MedMatch can do for you!

00:01:15.609 --> 00:01:25.060
Thank you for choosing MedMatch!

